    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21094" root="سهم" body-key="s">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَهَامٌ</span></b>  The <i>heat of the</i> [<i>wind called</i>] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَمُوم</span>; (S,
K;) and the <i>burning,</i> or <i>vehement, heat of
summer;</i> (K;) and the <i>clouds of dust thereof:</i>
or <i>a hot wind;</i> and <i>hot winds;</i> used alike as sing.
and pl. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُهُمٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And see what
next follows.

